      "message": "Is `NetworkRequest` able to represent the following demand?\n\n\nThe AIL needs to be multicast capable so it should be a non-cellular default network. For example, if the default network is cellular but there is also local-only Wi-Fi network, the AIL should be the Wi-Fi network.",
