      "message": "Yes, you can call `addTransportType` with all transports you\u0027re willing to accept, e.g.\n\n    .addTransportType(TRANSPORT_WIFI);\n    .addTransportType(TRANSPORT_BLUETOOTH);\n    .addTransportType(TRANSPORT_ETHERNET);\n    .addTransportType(TRANSPORT_USB);\n\nThis will match any network having one of the above transports (and prefer the best one).",
